					<attribute id="Content" type="28" handle="hf60480b9g97c2g4614g9b58g57dfd53f900c" value="A Black Ring alchemist, Margaret tripped and fell into a barrel of cursed wine intended for the Divine. She emerged marinated in toxic ooze - and highly suggestible. She's cursed to obey any who can bear her odious presence. Margaret leaves her mark (a poison trail) wherever she goes and dissolves into a quivering puddle of toxic ooze upon death." />
